## 3. Key Conversations – Hội thoại giao tiếp

### Conversation A: Nhận ra đồ vật của bạn

> **A:** Excuse me, is this your phone?
> **B:** Oh, yes! It is. Thank you so much!
> **A:** No problem. I found it on the chair.
> **B:** I'm so glad. It's my new phone!

### Conversation B: Hỏi về đồ vật thú vị

> **A:** Wow, that's a nice bag! Is it new?
> **B:** Yes, it is. It's my sister's actually.
> **A:** Really? Where is it from?
> **B:** It's from Korea. She bought it last month.

### Conversation C: Trong lớp học

> **Teacher:** OK class, whose notebook is this? It's on my desk.
> **Student A:** Is it yours, Minh?
> **Student B:** Hmm, no. It isn't mine. Mine is here.
> **Student C:** Oh! It's mine! Sorry, teacher!

